## Company Overview
SoundBoxStore specializes in premium acoustic solutions for modern offices. Our products provide 30-35 dB sound reduction (blocking ~95% of office noise), helping create private, focused work environments. All products are ISO 23351-1 certified and feature modular designs for easy installation and relocation.

