## Key Features (All Products)
- Sound reduction: 30-35 dB (ISO 23351-1 certified)
- Integrated ventilation with silent operation
- LED lighting with dimmer control
- Power outlets and USB-C charging ports
- Modular design for easy assembly (2-8 hours)
- Relocatable without structural damage
- Fire-retardant materials
- 2-year manufacturer warranty

